      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In order to ensure seamless appraisal of evidence, the court has framed following point of determination :\n1. Whether the accused Sunil Kumar on 17.11.2013, at about 08.30 am, at Ajmeri Gate Chowk, Delhi was driving a DTC bus bearing regist"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "a6284794c09f47b98c010ca0963e7719_312",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The onus to prove the above point of determination shall be on the prosecution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ce8493bfaf7a45de93f50aaf43b2610b_313",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The prosecution must establish that (1) The alleged vehicle was being driven rashly and negligently."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "28a7c0be4fa44c2c880318bf47300765_314",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(2) The alleged State vs Sunil Kumar on 17 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/16669663/\n8 vehicle was being driven by the accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "da2b71ae2aed4b01a469e64a48539ae2_315",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(3) The act of the accused caused death of the deceased Heera Mani."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6dbdaa617b954e9db3281e679fda7c70_316",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n(4) The accused was driving the said vehicle without a valid badge."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2d6a3b9ca7d94f84ab761ea7c589aea6_317",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "26. In order to ensure convenience and avoid repetition of evidence, the first and the third issues are being discussed simultaneously."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "96e9121f7a344bf98b1577230c0734be_318",
      "summary_section": "issue",
      "labels": [
        "ISSUE"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:issue"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nHence, the issue for determination is whether the said vehicle was being driven rashly and negligently and in consequence of the same, it caused death of the deceased Heera Mani.\n27."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "103bd82ea52147a6a4f56fcdedf25a9a_319",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In order to prove the said point of determination, the factum of rashness and negligence has to be gathered from the surrounding of circumstances."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "31fc49408a3e407e9f074b7cc848b27c_320",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Hon'ble Supreme Court in Ravi Kapoor vs.\nState of Rajasthan [Crl. Appeal No. 1838/2009"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c1a699359cf84315aa3f2dc7acb25471_321",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "] inter alia held as under:\n\"In order to examine the merit or otherwise of contentions (b) and (c) raised on behalf of the appellant, it is necessary for the Court to first and foremost State Vs.\nSunil Kumar PS Kamla Market examine (a) what"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "62ce5238a73f4662af47e981a536e3eb_322",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Rash and negligent driving has to be examined in light of the facts and circumstances of a given case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5dd3324322af4dc89b0bbb629ebcf04f_323",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is a fact incapable of being construed or seen in isolation."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ce00f8b55644a16a2f2b8a15508ef9c_324",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It must be examined in light of the attendant circumstances."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "26a5c425dd2b42689da62726917c0b54_325",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "PRE_RELIED"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A person who drives a vehicle on the road is liable to be held responsible for the act as well as for the result."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2dffc29adea4488daef0f762402f8959_326",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It may not be always possible to determine with reference to the speed of a vehicle whether a person was driving rashly and negligently."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "36b4e53bc4804d1ebaf9d42d4c00a113_327",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Both these acts presuppose an abnormal conduct."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5eaddccec12141a09380444b5f995164_328",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even when one is driving a vehicle at a slow speed but recklessly and negligently, it would amount to 'rash and negligent driving' within the meaning of the language of Section 279 IPC."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "68c747b73e194d6982dcbf6292e4cbe5_329",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "That is why the legislature has used the words 'manner so rash or negligent as to endanger human life'."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2e4e15fd452740e88da1dc3d362a21ad_330",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The preliminary conditions, thus, are that (a) it is the manner in which the vehicle is driven; (b) it be driven either rashly or negligently;\nand (c) such rash or negligent driving should be such as to endanger human life.\nOnce these ingre"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ef27a2302e34f7eab023a214446fd27_331",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Negligence is not an absolute term but is a relative one;\nit is rather a comparative term."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "894077108ecb4e6a8698cd3ab7b522b2_332",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is difficult to state with precision any mathematically exact formula by which negligence or lack of it can be infallibly measured in a given case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "61e5783fcb364d3bbbd6ec08b58a7b5d_333",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Whether there exists negligence per se or the course of conduct amounts to negligence will normally depend upon the attending and surrounding facts and circumstances which have to be taken into consideration by the Court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "502209fcba954addbcfa6e7de8820eff_334",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In a given case, even not doing what one was ought to do can constitute State vs Sunil Kumar on 17 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/16669663/\n9 negligence.\nThe Court has to adopt another parameter, i.e., 'reasonab"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "95b008daccfa487ab8bfe920fe8d31ad_335",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The doctrine of reasonable care imposes an obligation or a duty upon a person (for example a driver) to care for the pedestrian on the road and this duty attains a higher degree when the pedestrian happen to be children of tender years."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f2c5ac14c53148dcb843415ddc6c8630_336",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is axiomatic to say that while driving a vehicle on a public way, there is an implicit duty cast on the drivers to see that their driving does not endanger the life of the right users of the road, may be either vehicular users or pedestr"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "80f7f8b09b2a45ec94ccaa37a31a2ed9_337",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "They are expected to take sufficient care to avoid danger to others\"."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8812e79b68874d1d919be3381439f689_338",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "28. Hence, it is the duty of the driver of the alleged vehicle to observe a reasonable duty of care while driving on the route."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "71b3906ecdb041d9828ebf21454d5709_339",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is an implicit duty on the driver to check that their driving does not State Vs.\nSunil Kumar PS Kamla Market endanger the life of the pedestrians or other persons using the road."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "aa8209a1377248c4bbac0698b1d9f42f_340",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "29. In the present factual matrix, PW-2 has stood as the star eye witness to the present case."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "46a4d93d0e494922a6f60ec4c787e9c9_341",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He is alleged to have been present at the spot at the time of alleged accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "62a7f0856731451497b1e808d8ad71a1_342",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-2 has categorically stated that he has snack stall from the last 18 years at the site of Fawara Park, and on the day of the incident, he was having tea near the peepal tree just opposite to New Delhi Metro Station."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8a8492d5cf64452a84d069796d54a545_343",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He states that he saw one DTC bus bearing no. ...........9479 coming in a high speed from the Paharganj side and hit one person who was trying to cross the road near New Delhi Metro Station and the said person fell on the road."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "892d67bff44d4d998cff3def0787a36c_344",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said witness stood unrebutted in his cross-examination."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "edb226447d2245e291a69fd89fdf5da4_345",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He went on to state that despite traffic he could see the incident that took place at around 8.30 am."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2cfaaf1a4c6d48729c501abee27f45d4_346",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He also deposed the entire registration number of said bus in his cross-examination."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "2c2b0a171e3f4a25ac96cd5cab41c195_347",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "30. Nothing material has been elicited in his cross-examination, which could create aspersions on his testimony with respect to the rash and negligent driving."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "36086439ce5a4580a28bfdde1f01df59_348",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Also while examining and appreciating of evidence of PW-2, who happens to be a bystander, the fact cannot be ignored that he is not found or shown to have any axe to grind against the accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "30f7bf6f0ab54206b9dc2ebae45771d0_349",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Hence, he shall not implicate any innocent person in commission of the said crime."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e53a59910eac4047bf7422b03aa9ce7f_350",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "31. His testimony has been corroborated by PW-3 Ct. Jagdish who has categorically stated in his examination-in-chief that on the alleged day of accident at about 8.30 am, he had witnessed a DTC bus bearing no. DL1PC9479 coming from a very h"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3d7692b22bf492abcf44ce41a5c35e4_351",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "32. The factum of rash and negligent driving of the alleged vehicle is also established by the result that ensued."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b62e58acf813491a8daf0a9f8c8da40f_352",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-2 who is the star eye witness of the case has deposed that the offending bus was being driven so rashly and negligently that the passenger who fell on the road due to the accident,\nsubsequently died."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "36f7cf86d8724cab8c5224c02c51ca8f_353",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The driver of the bus / accused had also sustained injured as he had applied the brakes with full force."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "868225e4957548b8be43e982f8014a02_354",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the post mortem report Ex.A-2, the death was the consequence of blunt force trauma on the head leading to cerebral damage."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c972456e8bee401189fa3be6a5adbe7a_355",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The deceased died at around 2.15 pm on 17 November which is within 6 hours of the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "55328708ceff4aedb70a185fe8fe6ed2_356",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The effect of the accident on the offending vehicle State vs Sunil Kumar on 17 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/16669663/\n10 is also a testament of the speed at which it was being driven."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f6d50847e810417d908e23aa42da35e2_357",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The mechanical inspection report dated 19.11.2013 ExPW7/A indicates that there were fresh damages to the vehicle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ef5b4e7120af4677ae6e5e7905fba35a_358",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The front wind screen was broken from right side."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "28e88e6cd6b148dc810fcadb42a43e73_359",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even by applying the principle of res ipsa loquitor, it can be established that the mere fact of accident, is prima facie evidence of such negligence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "07693856855d4a909475701bcbf53ca7_360",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "33. Hence, in view of the above discussion, the prosecution has been able to establish beyond reasonable doubt that the offending was being driven in a rash and negligent manner."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5e8c6b41ef0640f0ac4eaa2599c25c0c_361",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "34. The next issue for determination before this court is whether the offending vehicle was being driven by the accused on the day of the accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0dd9251d8f2b43a19367a06be6f62ce3_362",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nState Vs. Sunil Kumar PS Kamla Market 35."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d9aa3a5dd0c649e58cf5d325f1e4fd8d_363",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The onus to prove the same shall be on the prosecution."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cebd2c4163f7407eb3af44e8c152666e_364",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The star witness of the prosecution PW-2 has categorically stated that he was present at the incident spot and had seen the CAT ambulance taking the driver / accused to the hospital, since he too had suffered injuries as a result of applyin"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9a14a3277c584f77a63f049929cf8732_365",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said witness established the identity of the accused by successfully identifying him in the court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1073d07e77f0467abf53a8e04f895106_366",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said witness also identified the offending bus after the photographs were shown to him."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d27a60003d274266bd493c0d7a75bfcf_367",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The chain of circumstances as explained by him can be corroborated by the testimony of PW-3 Ct. Jagdish who also correctly identified the accused in the court after seeing him at the spot."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "30e94760284e4e2ba07b97ed23630c08_368",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In his cross-examination, he had explicitly mentioned that he had seen the accused at the time of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "db4857ce65f2483dba84864b66577ddf_369",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-5 Jitender Singh was posted as the Assistant Ambulance officer in the CAT's ambulance that took the accused to the LNJP hospital."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4c802f7c4c6b4a2cb063cef20bf3bb0d_370",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-5 corroborated the version of PW-2 and PW-3."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ea64c106cf1344e9bf993dc0e404c961_371",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The MLC of the accused dated 17.11.2013 is also on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ed74ee093a234db58eb36e9e3f955689_372",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It stamps the presence of the accused at the LNJP hospital at 8.47 am on 17.11.2013."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5901d753b9ae4be79eae52450c8de54d_373",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the MLC, accused suffered minor injury."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b1e6908813df427695a4624452b6cc38_374",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The chain of circumstances as deposed by PW-2 and PW-3 are fortified by the testimony by PW-8 who has categorically stated that after registration of the FIR,\nthe print out of the FIR along with the rukka was handed over to Ct. Balbir."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "974e517f6a4a432e8e8e49fbc7686abe_375",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-9 Ct. Balbir has deposed that on 17.11.2013 at about 9.30 am, he came to the spot along with the IO and the driver accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5011646f573d4c6980f77981a111422b_376",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-9 also correctly identified the accused State Vs. Sunil Kumar PS Kamla Market in the court."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9a940bbd395c4651930b0eea76cac8a2_377",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "PW-11 IO / SI Ramesh Chand stated that on the day of the accident, he inquired the name and address of the bus driver and has correctly done the dock identification of the accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7c7191320f7c4b3084a1cfb6a0432e83_378",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The site plan was prepared by the IO at the instance of PW-2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "99304c9918624fbd8276d5c19d59516b_379",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Even the arrest memo bears the signatures of PW-2."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "60d5cb8f069848fba96024921b2815ba_380",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nAs already stated, PW-2 is an independent eye witness and his presence during various stages of investigation has lended support to the testimony of formal witnesses."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "be9d0a0110b74da0b7bd956eeaeaa686_381",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "At this juncture, I also deemed it relevant to mention the statement of the accused recorded u/s 313 CrPC, wherein he has explicitly stated that he was driving the bus with safety and slow speed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ee83e6987234d2db874f932338776ff_382",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already discussed above in the previous issue, the factum of rashness and negligence has already been proved against him."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d6764ced4ee549f3b52387f7ba2e7c74_383",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nRather this statement of the accused lends support to the case of the prosecution by establishing his presence at the scene of crime in the offending bus."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3f58007df063481487bed115eea14560_384",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "36. Hence, in view of the above said discussion, the prosecution has been able to aptly establish that the offending vehicle was being driven by the accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f7ddcb01d7534a9da33b527e09937e3e_385",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nState vs Sunil Kumar on 17 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/16669663/\n11 37."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "21da70e08bbd4d4e86d637866c610cc8_386",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The last issue to be determined by this court is whether the accused was driving the offending vehicle without a valid badge."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f7a0f61e15ae4b478dc9269e9194ffb0_387",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "38. The photocopy of the badge of the accused numbered as P031308035 is on record, according to which, the said badge was issued on 20.11.2013."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cd2fff029b9d421faee0d1adce8f3af9_388",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The said accident took placed on 17.11.2013, when the accused was driving the offending vehicle."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "20a76c5bf30f4bc38338e3b39e695f6c_389",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As already discussed above, the factum of said vehicle being driven by the State Vs. Sunil Kumar PS Kamla Market accused on the day of the accident has been proved beyond reasonable doubt."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4533aab503d147deabfbad850c9a4ae6_390",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "39. The accused has not been able to furnish any document / original badge which was valid on the day of accident."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "21caed4d7b674ff59b1a2e455dca3e2b_391",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "He has merely stated in his statement recorded u/s 313 CrPC that he was driving the offending vehicle with a valid badge."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f4a1c520572b48839d98177b9d036501_392",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "However, he has not been able to discharge his onus to prove the same."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8959bd7f76044130a56706eb98d4d76f_393",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "As per the photocopy of the driver badge on record, the accused was driving the offending vehicle without a valid badge."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "00155a57b6f44654953604823a6a04e0_394",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "40. Therefore, in view of the abovesaid discussion, the prosecution has been able to establish the ingredients of offences u/s 279, 304A IPC and 6DMVR/177 MV Act against the accused."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "f3a0ef5cbd8646b480da6a76b286a326_395",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "41. Hence, the court deems it apposite to convict the accused u/s u/s 279, 304A IPC and 6DMVR/177 MV Act."
    }
  ],
